<InfoPage title="Built for better buying decisions." eyebrow="ABOUT FITGEAR" intro="Fitness gear research without inflated claims or confusing advice.">
<h2>Our mission</h2><p>FitGear Review Hub is an independent fitness equipment editorial project. We want to help beginners, home-gym builders and regular gym-goers understand what to compare before buying.</p>
<h2>How our recommendations work</h2><p>We prioritize clearly described use cases, specification checks, realistic limitations and honest sourcing. Product pages identify whether information comes from hands-on testing or desk research. Demo pages do not claim to be real evaluations.</p>
<h2>How this site earns revenue</h2><p>When affiliate programs are approved, some links may lead to retailers that pay a commission. These relationships will be disclosed and should never override the editorial selection process.</p>
<h2>Who publishes the content?</h2><p><strong>Owner action required:</strong> Replace the placeholder author identity with your actual name, relevant experience, and contact information before publishing real reviews. No qualifications or team members have been invented.</p>
<p><a href="/how-we-test/">Read our evaluation methodology →</a></p>
</InfoPage>
